      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Upright is extremely important and should be documented: it controls crouch/prone/standing (0 = on floor; 1 = standing upright at calibrated/initial height) The default base crouches at 0.7 and goes prone (crawl) at 0.5\nThe others, don't seem like they are being used yet.\nTwo more undocumented parameters from the example controller:\nLocomotionMode (int)\nFootstepDisable (bool)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
