      "statusChangeNewStatus": "complete",
      "value": "Documentation complete!\nAngularY and Upright are implemented and has been documented.\nSupine and GroundProximity are not implemented yet. This will be documented as \"not implemented\".\nLocomotionMode and FootstepDisable were previous properties that we no longer use, and those were left behind in the default controller. They do nothing and will not be documented.",
